    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32379" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλῐπής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλείπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>failing, deficient,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλίου ἐκλιπές τι ἐγένετο,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκλειψις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.52
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i>deficient in..,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Xen.</u>
				980a6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>omitted, overlooked,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.97
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.12.2
			</span></i>.</div>
